cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "GMM-UBM motion signatures for cross-recording similarity of conversational head and hand motion"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived results for a study that summarises each conversation
  recording as a motion signature (a Gaussian Mixture Model adapted from a shared
  Universal Background Model) and compares recordings by cross-fitted
  log-likelihood ratio, merging four per-speaker, per-body-part rankings into a
  consensus score. Published as an analysis record for a proof-of-concept study.
